▌Root (bindings.root)                                                                                                                                 |
▌ x                 toggle-viewed          Tick or untick the PR file's Viewed checkbox on GitHub                                                     |
▌ p                 toggle-local-only      Move the comment between your draft review, which sync posts, and local-only                               |
▌ o                 show-on-github         Open the PR file, hunk, line or comment on GitHub, to comment there                                        |
▌ i                 write-comment          Write a comment or a reply, or edit your own comment                                                       |
▌ @                 message-agent          Message an agent running delta tui review listen, about the thread or the PR                               |
▌ Y                 show-refs              List branches and tags                                                                                     |
▌ g+s               status                 Status view, from any view                                                                                 |
▌ H                 renderer-features      List delta features, shell commands and views, and set their keys                                          |
▌ T                 renderer-themes        Step through delta's themes                                                                                |
▌ s                 stage                  Stage the file, hunk or line                                                                               |
▌ u                 unstage                Unstage the file, hunk or line                                                                             |
▌ enter             show                   Open the commit, branch, tag, stash or blame line; open a file, hunk or line in your editor                |
▌ right             show-or-unfold         Open the commit, branch, tag, stash or blame line; unfold a folded file or hunk                            |
▌ alt+enter         show-in-alt-editor     Open the file, hunk or line in general.alt_editor                                                          |
▌ K                 discard                Discard the file, hunk or line                                                                             |
▌ a                 apply                  Apply the file, hunk or line                                                                               |
▌ v                 reverse                Reverse the file, hunk or line                                                                             |
▌ y                 copy-hash              Copy the commit's hash                                                                                     |
▌ B                 blame                  Blame the file of the diff line under the cursor                                                           |
▌ tab               toggle-section         Fold or unfold                                                                                             |
▌ shift+tab         toggle-all-sections    Fold every file; again, unfold everything                                                                  |
▌ U                 diff-context           Set the diff context                                                                                       |
▌ +                 wider-diff-context     Wider diff context                                                                                         |
▌ -                 narrower-diff-context  Narrower diff context                                                                                      |
▌ :                 edit-git-command       Edit the git command                                                                                       |
▌ &                 file-patterns          Set which files to show                                                                                    |
▌ d                 hide-file              Hide the file under the cursor                                                                             |
▌ k up              move-up-line           Up a line, through a diff's lines too                                                                      |
▌ j down            move-down-line         Down a line, through a diff's lines too                                                                    |
